{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56688","headline":"五代幽蓟人诗 · 无名氏","name":"五代幽蓟人诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月明星稀夜，皆欲向南飞。\n（见《古今诗话》，《增修诗话总龟前集》卷二十引。\n《全五代诗话》卷十二录此诗前有後人附加之「要识涂鸦意，栖迟未得归」二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}